Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:13.38,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:13.38,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}中岛布兰登 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7(3) {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(4) {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 梅德韦杰夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:02.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Brandon, huge congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,布兰登 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:04.50,EN,,0,0,0,,You are enjoying yourself out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,看得出你很享受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.90,EN,,0,0,0,,What a comeback, saving match points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场逆转 你救回了赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,How were you able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to get across the line today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,把这条线拿下的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.80,EN,,0,0,0,,down match points, just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,当时赛点在身 我就是想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:14.82,EN,,0,0,0,,to tell myself to just kind of find a way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,告诉自己 总得找到办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,just keep fighting for every point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都拼到底
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.38,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,if he's able to to close it out there, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,他要是把那盘拿下了 我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:20.06,EN,,0,0,0,,too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,那也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,But, you know, just keep fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我就是一直咬牙坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and managed to get into a third set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,终于拖进了第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah, super happy with the level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,对自己在第三盘的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.86,EN,,0,0,0,,in the third.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,It's amazing watching you around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你在场上真的很神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:28.46,EN,,0,0,0,,the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,满场跑动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You always look calm, composed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,永远看着又冷静又从容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you feel that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你自己也这么觉得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:32.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Is there any tension inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,心里真的不紧张吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,No, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,不 当然会紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.10,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:35.96,EN,,0,0,0,,throughout these matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,整场比赛下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.42,EN,,0,0,0,,there's always ups and downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,总有起有落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, times where I'm feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实会有那种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:42.34,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, maybe not as good or, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:42.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,状态没那么好 或者说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:45.24,EN,,0,0,0,,feeling more confident, but just try to stick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,信心不太够 但我就是想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,through every moment and, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,撑过每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:47.70,EN,,0,0,0,,keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直拼下去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:49.32,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been an amazing summer so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个夏天到现在真的很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.98,EN,,0,0,0,,You can take so many positives you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:51.58,EN,,0,0,0,,and your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,能收获很多正能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.86,EN,,0,0,0,,What has been the biggest impact for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你影响最大的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:58.66,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know, of course, my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 当然是我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,all of them, we've put in so much hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有人 我们下了太多苦功
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:02.46,EN,,0,0,0,,on the practice courts and the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,在训练场上 在健身房里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, I'm really thankful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for all their hard work and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们付出的所有努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.50,EN,,0,0,0,,just super happy with myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,也为自己感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,for just fighting for everything out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了每一分拼到底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Very well done. Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:11.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Best of luck. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:11.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
